  "prefLabel": "He-W 511.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 511.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to describe the requirements for enrollment in the health insurance premium payment program (HIPP), which uses medicaid funds to purchase employer group health plan coverage on behalf of a medicaid recipient, as allowed by 42 USC §1396e.\n\nSource. #10632, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14075, eff 9-20-24, EXPIRES: 9-20-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
